  "cooked": "<p>I had another look at <a href=\"https://viniciuscestarii.github.io/bitcoin-node-os-fingerprint/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">OS Fingerprinting of Bitcoin Nodes</a>. Happy to see that you\u2019ve been updating it!</p>\n<p>For Linux, the numbers seem relatively stable, with a slight increase (which might be variance). About 7800-7900 IPv4 and IPv6 Linux nodes. I wonder how many of these are listening on both IPv4 and IPv6 and are counted here twice. Maybe <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/danielabrozzoni\">@danielabrozzoni</a> can help with data from <a href=\"https://delvingbitcoin.org/t/fingerprinting-nodes-via-addr-requests/1786\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Fingerprinting nodes via addr requests - Protocol Design - Delving Bitcoin</a>.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/04e9e82ccea20a9c1d897d99c9d32e482c15378d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/04e9e82ccea20a9c1d897d99c9d32e482c15378d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/04e9e82ccea20a9c1d897d99c9d32e482c15378d.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"Ht3ipkxJf7Ffe2JUqsWvFz3crr\" width=\"690\" height=\"356\" data-dominant-color=\"23384F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1498\u00d7774 49.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Similar for Windows. Somewhere around 500 nodes responded on IPv4 and IPv6.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/44306311cca90db68c058f0d53dffeac850a6b70.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/44306311cca90db68c058f0d53dffeac850a6b70\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/44306311cca90db68c058f0d53dffeac850a6b70.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9Je8teXlwyt7rPcQ1JJKQ6HnKmI\" width=\"690\" height=\"351\" data-dominant-color=\"4A2A1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1497\u00d7763 46.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Unknown, Other/Device, and Other have been rising.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/cdde7bdeeb30ee43492807ac6971e7cf258202b4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/cdde7bdeeb30ee43492807ac6971e7cf258202b4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/cdde7bdeeb30ee43492807ac6971e7cf258202b4.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"tncy9NnUGMnyhLnKvHmMsT2lVOs\" width=\"690\" height=\"357\" data-dominant-color=\"2D2F2D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1484\u00d7769 44.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Around 100 nodes are running on MacOS:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/506abf46ebe6436bf3f1ee9f2f8b3737fbe2e94c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/506abf46ebe6436bf3f1ee9f2f8b3737fbe2e94c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/506abf46ebe6436bf3f1ee9f2f8b3737fbe2e94c.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"btoTWQvUTd4GxhFQquUQTTvcj6s\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" data-dominant-color=\"462832\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1480\u00d7777 43.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Somewhere around 150-200 nodes on BSD:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/083497ae728f05aef9e11a54530108a2e4230e82.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/083497ae728f05aef9e11a54530108a2e4230e82\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/083497ae728f05aef9e11a54530108a2e4230e82.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1aAuUX7qQjmFsERqC9dR4Q2ZzA6\" width=\"690\" height=\"355\" data-dominant-color=\"3E3015\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1495\u00d7771 45 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>And around 100 are identified as Android:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/81e1e78a6d813e6f70b64608116511b88863d3ad.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/81e1e78a6d813e6f70b64608116511b88863d3ad\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/81e1e78a6d813e6f70b64608116511b88863d3ad.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iwZAGHeT0kjS7ngXeAoR4rwtvJj\" width=\"690\" height=\"354\" data-dominant-color=\"163115\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1493\u00d7767 43.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>A single one is identified as Solaris.</p>",
